{"1-4":{"people":[],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"H1621","lemma":"גַּרְגְּרוֹת","tr":"gar·ge·rot","gloss":"neck","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":4},{"base":"H3820","lemma":"לֵב","tr":"lev","gloss":"heart","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":595},{"base":"H0408","lemma":"אַל","tr":"al","gloss":"not","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":724},{"base":"H7922","lemma":"שֵׂ֫כֶל","tr":"se·khel","gloss":"understanding","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":16},{"base":"H3871","lemma":"לוּחַ","tr":"lu·ach","gloss":"tablet","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":43},{"base":"H7194","lemma":"קָשַׁר","tr":"qa·shar","gloss":"to conspire","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":44},{"base":"H5341","lemma":"נָצַר","tr":"na·tsar","gloss":"to watch","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":63},{"base":"H2580","lemma":"חֵן","tr":"chen","gloss":"favor","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":69},{"base":"H0753","lemma":"אֹ֫רֶךְ","tr":"o·rekh","gloss":"length","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":95},{"base":"H7911","lemma":"שָׁכַח","tr":"sha·khach","gloss":"to forget","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":102}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"LUK","chapter":2,"verse":52,"verseEnd":52,"votes":32,"source":"both","text":"And Jesus grew in wisdom and stature, and in favor with God and man.","from":4},{"book":"PRO","chapter":4,"verse":5,"verseEnd":5,"votes":29,"source":"both","text":"Get wisdom, get understanding; do not forget my words or turn from them.","from":1},{"book":"EPH","chapter":6,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":26,"source":"openbible","text":"Children, obey your parents in the Lord, for this is right.","from":2},{"book":"EPH","chapter":6,"verse":3,"verseEnd":3,"votes":26,"source":"openbible","text":"“that it may go well with you and that you may have a long life on the earth.”","from":2},{"book":"JHN","chapter":14,"verse":21,"verseEnd":21,"votes":25,"source":"openbible","text":"Whoever has My commandments and keeps them is the one who loves Me. The one who loves Me will be loved by My Father, and I will love him and reveal Myself to him.”","from":1},{"book":"JHN","chapter":14,"verse":24,"verseEnd":24,"votes":25,"source":"openbible","text":"Whoever does not love Me does not keep My words. The word that you hear is not My own, but it is from the Father who sent Me.","from":1},{"book":"PSA","chapter":119,"verse":16,"verseEnd":16,"votes":24,"source":"both","text":"I will delight in Your statutes; I will not forget Your word.","from":1},{"book":"PRO","chapter":7,"verse":3,"verseEnd":3,"votes":24,"source":"both","text":"Tie them to your fingers; write them on the tablet of your heart.","from":3}],"notes":[],"groups":[]},"5-10":{"people":[],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"H0618","lemma":"אָסָם","tr":"a·sam","gloss":"storehouse","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":2},{"base":"H8250","lemma":"שִׁקּוּי","tr":"shiq·quy","gloss":"drink","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":2},{"base":"H8270","lemma":"שֹׁר","tr":"shor","gloss":"umbilical cord","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":2},{"base":"H7647","lemma":"שָׂבָע","tr":"sa·va","gloss":"abundance","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":8},{"base":"H0408","lemma":"אַל","tr":"al","gloss":"not","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":724},{"base":"H3342","lemma":"יֶ֫קֶב","tr":"ye·qev","gloss":"wine","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":16},{"base":"H8172","lemma":"שָׁעַן","tr":"sha·an","gloss":"to lean","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":22},{"base":"H3474","lemma":"יָשַׁר","tr":"ya·shar","gloss":"to smooth","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":25},{"base":"H1952","lemma":"הוֹן","tr":"hon","gloss":"substance","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":26},{"base":"H0998","lemma":"בִּינָה","tr":"bi·nah","gloss":"understanding","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":38}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"PSA","chapter":37,"verse":5,"verseEnd":5,"votes":714,"source":"both","text":"Commit your way to the LORD; trust in Him, and He will do it.","from":5},{"book":"JER","chapter":17,"verse":7,"verseEnd":7,"votes":587,"source":"openbible","text":"But blessed is the man who trusts in the LORD, whose confidence is in Him.","from":5},{"book":"JER","chapter":17,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":587,"source":"openbible","text":"He is like a tree planted by the waters that sends out its roots toward the stream. It does not fear when the heat comes, and its leaves are always green. It does not worry in a year of drought, nor does it cease to produce fruit.","from":5},{"book":"PRO","chapter":28,"verse":26,"verseEnd":26,"votes":470,"source":"both","text":"He who trusts in himself is a fool, but one who walks in wisdom will be safe.","from":5},{"book":"PSA","chapter":37,"verse":3,"verseEnd":3,"votes":372,"source":"both","text":"Trust in the LORD and do good; dwell in the land and cultivate faithfulness.","from":5},{"book":"PSA","chapter":62,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":351,"source":"both","text":"Trust in Him at all times, O people; pour out your hearts before Him. God is our refuge. Selah","from":5},{"book":"ISA","chapter":26,"verse":3,"verseEnd":3,"votes":339,"source":"openbible","text":"You will keep in perfect peace the steadfast of mind, because he trusts in You.","from":5},{"book":"ISA","chapter":26,"verse":4,"verseEnd":4,"votes":339,"source":"openbible","text":"Trust in the LORD forever, because GOD the LORD is the Rock eternal.","from":5}],"notes":[],"groups":[]},"11-12":{"people":[],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"H0408","lemma":"אַל","tr":"al","gloss":"not","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":724},{"base":"H6973","lemma":"קוּץ","tr":"quts","gloss":"to loathe","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":9},{"base":"H8433","lemma":"תּוֹכֵחָה","tr":"to·khe·chah","gloss":"rebuke","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":28},{"base":"H4148","lemma":"מוּסָר","tr":"mu·sar","gloss":"discipline","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":50},{"base":"H7521","lemma":"רָצָה","tr":"ra·tsah","gloss":"to accept","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":56},{"base":"H3198","lemma":"יָכַח","tr":"ya·khach","gloss":"to rebuke","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":59},{"base":"H3988","lemma":"מָאַס","tr":"ma·as","gloss":"to reject","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":76},{"base":"H0157","lemma":"אָהֵב","tr":"a·hav","gloss":"to love: lover","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":211}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"JOB","chapter":5,"verse":17,"verseEnd":17,"votes":32,"source":"both","text":"Blessed indeed is the man whom God corrects; so do not despise the discipline of the Almighty.","from":11},{"book":"DEU","chapter":8,"verse":5,"verseEnd":5,"votes":23,"source":"both","text":"So know in your heart that just as a man disciplines his son, so the LORD your God disciplines you.","from":12},{"book":"HEB","chapter":12,"verse":5,"verseEnd":5,"votes":23,"source":"openbible","text":"And you have forgotten the exhortation that addresses you as sons: “My son, do not take lightly the discipline of the Lord, and do not lose heart when He rebukes you.","from":11},{"book":"HEB","chapter":12,"verse":12,"verseEnd":12,"votes":23,"source":"openbible","text":"Therefore strengthen your limp hands and weak knees.","from":11},{"book":"REV","chapter":3,"verse":19,"verseEnd":19,"votes":23,"source":"both","text":"Those I love, I rebuke and discipline. Therefore be earnest and repent.","from":11},{"book":"REV","chapter":3,"verse":19,"verseEnd":19,"votes":22,"source":"openbible","text":"Those I love, I rebuke and discipline. Therefore be earnest and repent.","from":12},{"book":"PSA","chapter":94,"verse":12,"verseEnd":12,"votes":19,"source":"both","text":"Blessed is the man You discipline, O LORD, and teach from Your law,","from":11},{"book":"PRO","chapter":29,"verse":17,"verseEnd":17,"votes":13,"source":"both","text":"Discipline your son, and he will give you rest; he will bring delight to your soul.","from":12}],"notes":[{"id":"prov-3-11-discipline","title":"The Lord disciplines the one he loves","kind":"quotation"}],"groups":[]},"13-20":{"people":[],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"H5504","lemma":"סַחַר","tr":"sa·char","gloss":"profit","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":7},{"base":"H8394","lemma":"תְּבוּנָה","tr":"ta·vu·nah","gloss":"understanding","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":42},{"base":"H2451","lemma":"חׇכְמָה","tr":"chokh·mah","gloss":"wisdom","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":153},{"base":"H9034","lemma":"הָ","tr":"ha","gloss":"her","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":490},{"base":"H7491","lemma":"רָעַף","tr":"ra·aph","gloss":"to drip","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":5},{"base":"H0120","lemma":"אָדָם","tr":"a·dam","gloss":"man","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":550},{"base":"H6443","lemma":"פְּנִינִים","tr":"pa·nin","gloss":"jewel","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":6},{"base":"H5278","lemma":"נֹ֫עַם","tr":"no·am","gloss":"pleasantness","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":7},{"base":"H6329","lemma":"פּוּק","tr":"puq","gloss":"to promote","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":7},{"base":"H1870","lemma":"דֶּ֫רֶךְ","tr":"de·rekh","gloss":"way: conduct","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":706}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"PSA","chapter":104,"verse":24,"verseEnd":24,"votes":12,"source":"both","text":"How many are Your works, O LORD! In wisdom You have made them all; the earth is full of Your creatures.","from":19},{"book":"PRO","chapter":11,"verse":30,"verseEnd":30,"votes":11,"source":"both","text":"The fruit of the righteous is a tree of life, and he who wins souls is wise.","from":18},{"book":"PRO","chapter":3,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":10,"source":"both","text":"for they will add length to your days, years and peace to your life.","from":16},{"book":"PRO","chapter":16,"verse":16,"verseEnd":16,"votes":10,"source":"both","text":"How much better to acquire wisdom than gold! To gain understanding is more desirable than silver.","from":14},{"book":"JER","chapter":10,"verse":12,"verseEnd":12,"votes":10,"source":"both","text":"The LORD made the earth by His power; He established the world by His wisdom and stretched out the heavens by His understanding.","from":19},{"book":"PRO","chapter":8,"verse":32,"verseEnd":32,"votes":9,"source":"openbible","text":"Now therefore, my sons, listen to me, for blessed are those who keep my ways.","from":13},{"book":"PRO","chapter":8,"verse":35,"verseEnd":35,"votes":9,"source":"openbible","text":"For whoever finds me finds life and obtains the favor of the LORD.","from":13},{"book":"PRO","chapter":15,"verse":4,"verseEnd":4,"votes":9,"source":"openbible","text":"A soothing tongue is a tree of life, but a perverse tongue crushes the spirit.","from":18}],"notes":[],"groups":[]},"21-26":{"people":[],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"H7901","lemma":"שָׁכַב","tr":"sha·khav","gloss":"to lie down: lay down","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":212},{"base":"H7272","lemma":"רֶ֫גֶל","tr":"re·gel","gloss":"foot","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":245},{"base":"H1621","lemma":"גַּרְגְּרוֹת","tr":"gar·ge·rot","gloss":"neck","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":4},{"base":"H3868","lemma":"לוּז","tr":"luz","gloss":"be devious","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":6},{"base":"H6149","lemma":"עָרַב","tr":"a·rev","gloss":"to please","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":8},{"base":"H0408","lemma":"אַל","tr":"al","gloss":"not","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":724},{"base":"H8454","lemma":"תּוּשִׁיָּה","tr":"tu·shiy·yah","gloss":"wisdom","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":12},{"base":"H3689","lemma":"כֶּ֫סֶל","tr":"ke·sel","gloss":"loin","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":13},{"base":"H7722","lemma":"שׁוֹא","tr":"sho","gloss":"ravage","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":13},{"base":"H4209","lemma":"מְזִמָּה","tr":"me·zim·mah","gloss":"plot","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":19}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"1SA","chapter":2,"verse":9,"verseEnd":9,"votes":23,"source":"both","text":"He guards the steps of His faithful ones, but the wicked perish in darkness; for by his own strength shall no man prevail.","from":26},{"book":"PSA","chapter":91,"verse":3,"verseEnd":3,"votes":23,"source":"both","text":"Surely He will deliver you from the snare of the fowler, and from the deadly plague.","from":26},{"book":"PRO","chapter":14,"verse":26,"verseEnd":26,"votes":23,"source":"both","text":"He who fears the LORD is secure in confidence, and his children shall have a place of refuge.","from":26},{"book":"PSA","chapter":3,"verse":5,"verseEnd":5,"votes":20,"source":"both","text":"I lie down and sleep; I wake again, for the LORD sustains me.","from":24},{"book":"PSA","chapter":4,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":18,"source":"both","text":"I will lie down and sleep in peace, for You alone, O LORD, make me dwell in safety.","from":24},{"book":"PSA","chapter":91,"verse":9,"verseEnd":9,"votes":18,"source":"openbible","text":"Because you have made the LORD your dwelling— my refuge, the Most High—","from":26},{"book":"PSA","chapter":91,"verse":10,"verseEnd":10,"votes":18,"source":"openbible","text":"no evil will befall you, no plague will approach your tent.","from":26},{"book":"JOS","chapter":1,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":14,"source":"both","text":"This Book of the Law must not depart from your mouth; meditate on it day and night, so that you may be careful to do everything written in it. For then you will prosper and succeed in all you do.","from":21}],"notes":[],"groups":[]},"27-35":{"people":[],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"H0408","lemma":"אַל","tr":"al","gloss":"not","lang":"h","inPassage":6,"uses":724},{"base":"H3887","lemma":"לִיץ","tr":"luts","gloss":"to mock","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":28},{"base":"H0854","lemma":"אֵת","tr":"et","gloss":"with","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":929},{"base":"H7453","lemma":"רֵעַ","tr":"re·a","gloss":"neighbor","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":188},{"base":"H3994","lemma":"מְאֵרָה","tr":"me·e·rah","gloss":"curse","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":5},{"base":"H3868","lemma":"לוּז","tr":"luz","gloss":"be devious","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":6},{"base":"H7451","lemma":"רַע","tr":"ra","gloss":"bad: harmful","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":661},{"base":"H7036","lemma":"קָלוֹן","tr":"qa·lon","gloss":"dishonor","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":17},{"base":"H0518","lemma":"אִם","tr":"im","gloss":"if","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":1067},{"base":"H5475","lemma":"סוֹד","tr":"sod","gloss":"counsel","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":21}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"GAL","chapter":6,"verse":10,"verseEnd":10,"votes":43,"source":"both","text":"Therefore, as we have opportunity, let us do good to everyone, and especially to the family of faith.","from":27},{"book":"JAS","chapter":2,"verse":15,"verseEnd":15,"votes":36,"source":"openbible","text":"Suppose a brother or sister is without clothes and daily food.","from":27},{"book":"JAS","chapter":2,"verse":16,"verseEnd":16,"votes":36,"source":"openbible","text":"If one of you tells him, “Go in peace; stay warm and well fed,” but does not provide for his physical needs, what good is that?","from":27},{"book":"JAS","chapter":4,"verse":6,"verseEnd":6,"votes":15,"source":"both","text":"But He gives us more grace. This is why it says: “God opposes the proud, but gives grace to the humble.”","from":34},{"book":"ROM","chapter":13,"verse":7,"verseEnd":7,"votes":14,"source":"both","text":"Pay everyone what you owe him: taxes to whom taxes are due, revenue to whom revenue is due, respect to whom respect is due, honor to whom honor is due.","from":27},{"book":"1PE","chapter":5,"verse":5,"verseEnd":5,"votes":14,"source":"both","text":"Young men, in the same way, submit yourselves to your elders. And all of you, clothe yourselves with humility toward one another, because, “God opposes the proud, but gives grace to the humble.”","from":34},{"book":"PRO","chapter":24,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":12,"source":"both","text":"Do not envy wicked men or desire their company;","from":31},{"book":"LEV","chapter":19,"verse":13,"verseEnd":13,"votes":11,"source":"both","text":"You must not defraud your neighbor or rob him. You must not withhold until morning the wages due a hired hand.","from":28}],"notes":[],"groups":[]}}